<title>GERMANY: Deutsche MG cuts Thyssen forecast.</title>
<headline>Deutsche MG cuts Thyssen forecast.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche MG confirmed on Thursday it had cut its earnings per share forecast on German steel-maker Thyssen AG from 17 marks to 14 marks for 1996.</p>
<p>The investment arm of Deutsche Bank also said it had dropped its 1997 forecast to 20 marks per share from 25.02 marks.</p>
<p>A bank spokesman added that the change in forecast dated from late last month.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
